  (lib_symbols)
  (text "05_Stack_Header J1  [zone: SOUTH - trunk to shield]
2x10 2.54mm stack header -- the ONLY inter-board path.
PIN GROUPING (deliberate): GND spread across; SPI block on pins nearest the
shield SPI spine; I2C block near PN532 side; UART block near C5/RV1106 side;
power (+3V3/+5V) on ends. Mirrors physical zones on BOTH boards." (at 15 15 0)
